noue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/23/1324846/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/23/1324846/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/23/1324846/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帝一の國、東京公演が無事\n千秋楽を迎えました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご観劇下さった皆さま、本当に有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の千秋楽の日は、劇場の上に大っきな虹ができていたそうな！(  *ω*  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーも、さゆりん、まりか、かなりん、若さま、らりん、まいまい、ゆったん、生駒ちゃん、いくちゃん、ひなちま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ひなちまの回にも、まあや、まいやん\nが、観に来てくれました(；＿；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな忙しい中、お仕事の合間をぬって観に来てくれて有難う( >_< 。 )\nブログや755やモバメにも色々書いてくれて、本当に嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/23/1324846/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃはー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに愛されて幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約2ヶ月間お世話になった、AiiAともさよなら(T_T)/~~~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いざ大阪へ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅田芸術劇場は、2年ぶり？？いつぶり？？\n覚えてないけど、楽しみます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"太陽ノック発売されました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんとのペアPVは、タイプAに収録されています。\nゼヒゼヒゼヒ、見てくださいね( *ˆoˆ* )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな発売日の昨日は、レコメンさんに出演させて頂いて、しっかり新曲のPRをしてきたよ(,,^_^,,)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/23/1324846/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぇーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/23/1324846/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/23/1324846/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/23/1324846/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/23/1324846/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}